WEBVTT

00:11:59.548 --> 00:12:04.011
Maybe we can still keep
our familiar story of civilization intact.

00:12:05.429 --> 00:12:06.638
And after all,

00:12:06.638 --> 00:12:12.686
if cities without rulers were really
such a common thing in human history,

00:12:12.686 --> 00:12:17.608
why didn't Cortéz and Pizarro
and all the other conquistadors

00:12:17.649 --> 00:12:21.153
find any when they began
their invasion of the Americas?

00:12:21.195 --> 00:12:25.532
Why did they find only
Moctezuma and Atahualpa

00:12:25.574 --> 00:12:27.659
lording it over their empires?

00:12:28.994 --> 00:12:31.079
Except that's not true either.